# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Yonatan Kurniawan et al. (2026). Comparative study of ensemble-based uncertainty quantification methods for neural network interatomic potentials.
#   Machine Learning Science and Technology. doi:10.1088/2632-2153/ae9fb4  arXiv:2508.06456v3
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2508.06456v3 (sha256 12571c35c82bee91...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 419 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/kurniawan2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the carbon DFT data set of an earlier study (diamond,
# graphite, monolayer and bilayer graphene from AIMD at 300-900 K and
# 1,500 K plus strained graphene; PBE with MBD for layered systems;
# 4,788 configurations, 90/10 split; Table 1), the Behler-Parrinello-type
# NNIP (three hidden layers of 128 tanh nodes, dropout 0.1, atom-centred
# symmetry functions) trained as four ensemble types, and their training
# and test RMSEs (Table 2). Uncertainty calibration and out-of-
# distribution analyses are UQ diagnostics.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-kurniawan2026 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Kurniawan et al. (2026): comparison of ensemble-based uncertainty quantification (bootstrap, dropout, random initialisation, snapshots) for neural-network interatomic potentials of carbon" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-kurniawan2026 .

