###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - For most ensembles the final epoch is chosen by the lowest loss on the test set, so the 'test' errors are not fully independent; the role follows the paper's label. Table 2 values are for the ensemble models as stated.
# - Uncertainty-versus-residual analyses (Figs. 6-10), feature-space and dropout-ratio studies are UQ diagnostics, not error metrics.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/kurniawan2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

